  "goodToKnow": "Der Solist (die Solistin) is a soloist: in a concert, choir or ballet. It's a weak noun: den Solisten. Das Solo is a solo, and in football ein Solo is a solo run with the ball. Figuratively, ein Solist is a loner or someone who acts alone, the opposite of a team player. The Berlin Philharmonic is one of the world's leading orchestras. Plural: die Solisten."
